 pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Christmas%20Token\">Christmas Tokens</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.9<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 12, 2006<br/>Christmas Update 2006</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20110217052022&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_Yellow_20cba9.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a gingerbread recipe.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">Use it to learn how to make gingerbread in the christmas bakery.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>You can now make gingerbread from normal cake dough in Santa's bakery.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>You can make <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbreadman\">gingerbreadmen</a> after you \"use\" this recipe, it will then disappear (only 1 can be used per character). <a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbreadman\">Gingerbreadmen</a> can be made using a <a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\">scythe</a> to cut <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">wheat</a> from a <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat%20Field\">wheat field</a>, grind it to <a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">flour</a> in a mill, add <a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">milk</a> with a trough or <a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">bucket</a> to make <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a> and bake on an oven at the <a href=\"#/wiki/Christmas%20Bakery\">Christmas Bakery</a> located in <a href=\"#/wiki/Vega\">Vega</a> under Santa's house.<br/>\nLooks the same as <a href=\"#/wiki/Research%20Notes\">Research Notes</a>, a Parchment (Poetry), a Parchment (Questionnaire), a <a href=\"#/wiki/Parchment%20%28Yellow%29\">Yellow Parchment</a>, and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Wrinkled%20Parchment\">Wrinkled Parchment</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ruprecht\">Ruprecht</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Vega\">Vega</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">10 <a href=\"#/wiki/Christmas%20Token\">Christmas Tokens</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">Bucket</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cake%20Keep%20Isle\">Cake Keep Isle</a></li><li>Christmas</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Christmas%20Bakery\">Christmas Bakery</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Christmas%20Token\">Christmas Token</a></li><li>Cooking</li><li>Documents and Papers</li><li>Duplicate Sprites</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\">Flour</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gingerbreadman\">Gingerbreadman</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">Milk</a></li><li>Parchment (Blood)</li><li>Parchment (Carnage)</li><li>Parchment (Excellent)</li><li>Parchment (Mud)</li><li>Parchment (Questionnaire)</li><li>Parchment (Roses)</li><li>Parchment (Sugar)</li><li>Parchment (Violets)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Parchment%20%28Yellow%29\">Parchment (Yellow)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Research%20Notes\">Research Notes</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ruprecht\">Ruprecht</a></li><li>Scam</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\">Scythe</a></li><li>Trough</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">Wheat</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wrinkled%20Parchment\">Wrinkled Parchment</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["hot-cuisine-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"3-2","n":20,"title":"Prato 13: Demonic Candy Balls","kind":"mention","coords":[{"x":33068,"y":32531,"z":6,"label":"Jean Pierre"}]}],"buy":[{"npc":"Ruprecht","where":"Vega","price":"10 Christmas Tokens","pos":{"x":31951,"y":31720,"z":7},"href":"#/wiki/Ruprecht"}]}}